<title>SINGAPORE: Venture upgraded to Singapore main board.</title>
<headline>Venture upgraded to Singapore main board.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics-based Venture Manufacturing (Singapore) Ltd said on Monday it will be upgraded to the main board of the Stock Exhange of Singapore (SES).</p>
<p>The company, currently listed on the SES second board, said it will send a circular to shareholders in due course to inform them of the effective date.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
